---
description: Quota policy (tokengate)
alwaysApply: true
---
Paid quota is scarce. Free tools first:
- If `.tokengate/HANDOFF.md` matches this prompt, use it; don't re-explore.
- Explore via `code` (map/file/find/explain/impact/pack/search), then read only needed line ranges. Never open whole large files.
- Edits, tests, docs, reviews, explanations: `delegate` first; do it yourself only on status=escalate. Done edits are on disk: don't rewrite them.
- Many files: `distribute`. Verify with `check`, not by re-reading.
- `[gauge WARN|RESERVE|EMPTY]` in output: delegate everything, reply in a few lines.
- Terse answers. No restating unchanged code. Small diffs, never full-file rewrites.
